{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X 对人物心理因果的交代不如 Y 完整，尤其结尾没有 Y 那样明确表达即使以后一直没有亲近的人，也愿意自己好好生活。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X 的重点句更短，【】突出后容易抓住每段核心，而且感受随音乐分段出现，观众不用一次处理所有信息。它对声音变化、身体感受和情绪转折的描写明显更细腻具体，听音乐时更容易找到对应的体验。Y 的人物心理解释和前后叙事更完整，但部分长句需要花时间读，音乐细节也被压缩了；综合边听边看的实际体验，我选 X。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d10a8e1d-01ed-49a3-bb68-9b1a5d79c498", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T071127678023Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:12:50.331646+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f3ee0fa7e58a11d917a596d5503f69e78ba37e9ea645ac48d5edc5e7317ea37d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, 